Package: marlinspike-capd
Version: __VERSION__
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-psutil, wireshark-common, libpcap0.8
Maintainer: MarlinSpike Project <noreply@localhost>
Description: Privileged capture sidecar for MarlinSpike (marlinspike-agent/web app)
 Enumerates interfaces, validates BPF filters, and supervises dumpcap
 with rotation, over a unix-domain socket guarded by SO_PEERCRED. Runs
 as its own unprivileged system user with only CAP_NET_RAW/CAP_NET_ADMIN
 granted — install this alongside marlinspike-agent on a remote sensor
 host to enable live capture control from the central console, or
 alongside the MarlinSpike web app itself for local capture.
